}]}]},{"id":10,"x":32,"y":21,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[1,4,1]}]}]},{"id":11,"x":33,"y":21,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[1,4,1]}]}]},{"id":13,"x":11,"y":25,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"SelfContainedUniverseReprise"]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,28,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["There is an Entity few know about in this world.\\! It has a habit of silencing those aware of it. I'm one of the few still alive."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["This being is somehow connected to the world. Perhaps, it is the spirit of the world.\\! Just as the light within our world fluctuates, so does the temperament of this being."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["As the light is now fading, the Entity is now seeking death.\\! Death not to itself, but to our entire world."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["We must, of course, stop it."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["When our god and our savior arrive, the Entity will attempt to manipulate them into shattering the lightbulb at the top of the spire."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Our god is the only thing this Entity can communicate with; it is through them that the savior will be tricked."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Shattering the ligthbulb will \\c[3]return the savior to their home world\\c[0], leaving ours to crumble.\\! But, as far as we know, this is the \\c[3]only way for the savior to return home\\c[0]."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["What do we do in a situation like this?\\! Tell the truth, causing the savior to leave?\\! Lie, only to have the entity reveal the truth?"]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["We can only hope they will have enough respect for the world they've seen when standing at the top of the spire and juding our fates."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,30,0]},{"code":10130,"params":[1,1,0,"niko"]},{"code":10110,"params":[".\\..\\.."]},{"code":10110,"params":["I don't want to end this world...\\! Is that what will happen if I leave..?"]},{"code":10320,"params":[0,0,31,0,1]},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,1,0,1]},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"george"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["I'm sure you realize the importance of saving ME, yes?"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is to leave at the start.\" That's what the book said."],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["Now take this, and remember my beauty forever."],"indent":1},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":1},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":1},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":1},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"george"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["Hopefully it reminds you of the terrible loss should you decide to abandon us, yes?"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["I have faith that you'll save me.\\! I mean, who wouldn't?"],"indent":1},{"code":22010,"params":[]},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,2,0,1],"indent":1},{"code":10130,"params":[1,1,0,"george"],"indent":2},{"code":10110,"params":["My honesty with you better pay off, kid.\\! Don't kill us."],"indent":2},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is to leave at the start.\" That's what the book said.\\! Dunno what it means."],"indent":2},{"code":10110,"params":["One last thing.\\! Take this."],"indent":2},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":2},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":2},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":2},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":2},{"code":10130,"params":[1,1,0,"george"],"indent":2},{"code":10110,"params":["Keep that as a reminder that there are people who depend on you.\\! Even me."],"indent":2},{"code":10110,"params":["So don't screw up, please."],"indent":2},{"code":22010,"params":[],"indent":1},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,3,0,1],"indent":2},{"code":10130,"params":[2,1,0,"george"],"indent":3},{"code":10110,"params":["Crazy.\\! It's all crazy."],"indent":3},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is to leave at the start.\" Found that in a book."],"indent":3},{"code":10110,"params":["Last thing."],"indent":3},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":3},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":3},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":3},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":3},{"code":10130,"params":[2,1,0,"george"],"indent":3},{"code":10110,"params":["It's a gift.\\! Go."],"indent":3},{"code":10110,"params":["Death sounds so boring.\\! Don't let it happen."],"indent":3},{"code":22010,"params":[],"indent":2},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,4,0,1],"indent":3},{"code":10130,"params":[3,1,0,"george"],"indent":4},{"code":10110,"params":["I know, that's soooo unfair..."],"indent":4},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is to leave at the start.\" I found that in a book.\\! I hope it helps!"],"indent":4},{"code":10110,"params":["Wait, one more thing!"],"indent":4},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":4},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":4},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":4},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":4},{"code":10130,"params":[3,1,0,"george"],"indent":4},{"code":10110,"params":["It's the cutest gift I had.\\! I hope it reminds you of me forever, 'kay?"],"indent":4},{"code":10110,"params":["We're all counting on you!"],"indent":4},{"code":22010,"params":[],"indent":3},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,5,0,1],"indent":4},{"code":10130,"params":[4,1,0,"george"],"indent":5},{"code":10110,"params":["I'm sure it's overwhelming.\\! But I'm sure you know in your heart what the right choice is."],"indent":5},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is to leave at the start.\" I found this after I finished translating. It's all I could find."],"indent":5},{"code":10110,"params":["And, sweetie, before you go, take this."],"indent":5},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":5},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":5},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":5},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":5},{"code":10130,"params":[4,1,0,"george"],"indent":5},{"code":10110,"params":["You're just so adorable I had to give you something."],"indent":5},{"code":10110,"params":["I know you'll make the right choice at the top of the spire."],"indent":5},{"code":22010,"params":[],"indent":4},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,6,0,0],"indent":5},{"code":10130,"params":[5,1,0,"george"],"indent":6},{"code":10110,"params":["So, like, not cool!\\! Lame!"],"indent":6},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is to leave at the start.\" I found that really weird thing in one of my books."],"indent":6},{"code":10110,"params":["Oh hey pal, you should take this too."],"indent":6},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":6},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":6},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":6},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":6},{"code":10130,"params":[5,1,0,"george"],"indent":6},{"code":10110,"params":["You're the coolest cat hugng out with in a while!\\! Maybe after you save the world we could be bros!"],"indent":6},{"code":10110,"params":["You are gonna save us, right?"],"indent":6}]}]},{"id":14,"x":20,"y":26,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[0,28,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["My prophecy will be fulfilled. The messiah will come."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["I may not live long enough to greet the messiah myself. But the robot will take care of that for me."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Here's to hoping it doesn't malfunction before the time comes."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,30,0]}]}]},{"id":15,"x":24,"y":25,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[0,28,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Phosphor"]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Blue phosphor comes in both mineral and organic forms. It is found on the surface of the  Barrens and inside seed shrimp."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Green phosphor is primarily organic. It is most commonly found inside  of moss and certain insects of the glen."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Red phosphor is primarily liquid and  flows in the streets of the Refuge. There is no known organic source of red phosphor."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,30,0]}]}]},{"id":16,"x":21,"y":26,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[1,14,1]}]}]},{"id":17,"x":25,"y":25,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[1,15,1]}]}]},{"id":18,"x":24,"y":29,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[0,28,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["The cycle shall begin anew."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,30,0]}]}]},{"id":19,"x":25,"y":29,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[1,18,1]}]}]},{"id":20,"x":29,"y":29,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[0,28,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["There are six."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Which face did you get?"]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,30,0]}]}]},{"id":21,"x":30,"y":29,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":12330,"params":[1,20,1]}]}]}]}